    "html": "<p>A satellite is orbiting a planet at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span> from the centre of the planet. How do the total energy and the kinetic energy of the satellite change when the satellite moves to an orbit at a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.5d\"></span> from the centre of the planet?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Kinetic energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Decreases</td>\n<td>Decreases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Decreases</td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n<td>Decreases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
